OL,3,GNEWSAPC sacked for sexual relationship
OL,4,Awith witness
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police officer committed gross
OL,7,Fmisconduct after he started a two-year
OL,8,Fsexual relationship with a witness he
OL,9,Fmet while investigating a supermarket
OL,10,Ftheft.
OL,12,FAnthony Lee, who had served with
OL,13,FNorthamptonshire Police since February
OL,14,F2018, would have been dismissed without
OL,15,Fnotice if he had not already resigned,
OL,16,Fthe force said.
OL,18,FA report, from a disciplinary hearing
OL,19,Fchaired by Chief Constable Ivan
OL,20,FBalhatchet, said Lee asked the witness
OL,21,Fto contact him on his personal phone.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
